{"data":{"degrees":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Technical High School in Software Development","school":"ETEC Taboão da Serra","date":"December 2023","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ce8bb/etects.jpg","srcSet":"/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/d6b18/etects.jpg 175w,\n/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/fac6d/etects.jpg 350w,\n/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ce8bb/etects.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/1934d/etects.avif 175w,\n/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/4564e/etects.avif 350w,\n/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/62eae/etects.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/745fa/etects.webp 175w,\n/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/37527/etects.webp 350w,\n/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ea0a8/etects.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":399}}},"tech":["Logic & Algorithms","Java (OOP)","SQL / Database","HTML/CSS","Delphi/C#"],"external":"https://www.etec.sp.gov.br"},"html":"<p>Comprehensive program focused on full software development lifecycle. Built a strong foundation in <strong>Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)</strong> and relational database modeling.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Capstone Project:</strong> Developed a desktop management system for local businesses using Java and MySQL.</li>\n<li>Learned hardware fundamentals, networking basics, and agile logic early in the career.</li>\n<li>Graduated with honors in logic and programming logic.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"B.S. in Science & Technology","school":"Universidade Federal do ABC","date":"May 2026","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/7ffd5ad4064cad06f1eaba2a33b8a9b5/5a159/ufabc.jpg","srcSet":"/static/7ffd5ad4064cad06f1eaba2a33b8a9b5/ba115/ufabc.jpg 63w,\n/static/7ffd5ad4064cad06f1eaba2a33b8a9b5/1a003/ufabc.jpg 125w,\n/static/7ffd5ad4064cad06f1eaba2a33b8a9b5/5a159/ufabc.jpg 250w","sizes":"(min-width: 250px) 250px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/7ffd5ad4064cad06f1eaba2a33b8a9b5/3284a/ufabc.avif 63w,\n/static/7ffd5ad4064cad06f1eaba2a33b8a9b5/42f51/ufabc.avif 125w,\n/static/7ffd5ad4064cad06f1eaba2a33b8a9b5/cbfed/ufabc.avif 250w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 250px) 250px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/7ffd5ad4064cad06f1eaba2a33b8a9b5/a6e40/ufabc.webp 63w,\n/static/7ffd5ad4064cad06f1eaba2a33b8a9b5/46142/ufabc.webp 125w,\n/static/7ffd5ad4064cad06f1eaba2a33b8a9b5/2cd09/ufabc.webp 250w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 250px) 250px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":392}}},"tech":["Advanced Calculus","Linear Algebra","Analytical Geometry","Physics","Scientific Method","Python for Data"],"external":"https://www.sua-universidade.edu.br"},"html":"<p>A rigorous STEM foundation degree focused on interdisciplinary problem-solving. This program provided a deep mathematical and scientific background essential for complex software engineering.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Core Curriculum:</strong> Mastered heavy quantitative subjects including Multivariable Calculus, Differential Equations, and Probability Statistics.</li>\n<li><strong>Scientific Approach:</strong> Developed strong analytical skills to approach technological problems using the scientific method and data analysis.</li>\n<li>Served as the foundational track before specializing in Software Engineering.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"B.S. in Computer Science","school":"Universidade Federal do ABC","date":"January 2028","cover":null,"tech":["Data Structures","Algorithms & Complexity","Operating Systems","Distributed Systems","Compiler Construction","Software Architecture"],"external":"https://www.sua-universidade.edu.br"},"html":"<p>Core Computer Science curriculum focusing on the mathematical and theoretical foundations of computing.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Computer Science Fundamentals:</strong> Deep dive into algorithmic complexity (Big O), memory management, concurrency, and thread safety in Java/C++.</li>\n<li><strong>System Design:</strong> Studied the architecture of scalable operating systems and distributed networks.</li>\n<li><strong>Capstone Project:</strong> Developed <strong>\"EcotrashV2\"</strong>, a full-stack mobile solution for waste management, applying concepts of Geolocation APIs and Cloud Database integration.</li>\n</ul>"}}]}}}